<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-UPMC H1 gold output up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-UPMC H1 gold output up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months gold output to June 30.</p>
<p>    Gold production	23,232 ounces  vs  18,317</p>
<p>    Ore milled	     82,509 tonnes  vs  73,811</p>
<p>    Grade		 9.32 grams gold/T vs  8.31</p>
<p>    Mill recovery	  93.99 percent  vs 92.88</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
